**/.idea/
**/target/

# QA-40 — Playwright output from the example suites. Each example config sets its own
# `outputDir` under its own directory, so its traces and failure artefacts land here instead of
# in the repo root's. The root .gitignore's `/test-results/` is anchored to the repo root and
# does not reach a nested path — mirrored here the way
# packages/galvanized-pukeko-vue-ui/.gitignore already mirrors it for that package.
#
# The html report is NOT covered here, because it does not land here: with no explicit
# `outputFolder`, Playwright resolves `playwright-report` by walking up for a package.json, not
# from the config's directory, so an example's html report is still written to the repo root's
# `playwright-report/` and overwrites whatever the root config last put there. That is a
# separate defect from the one this `outputDir` closes and is not fixed here.
**/test-results/
